<title>USA: G.F.W. Pub. Scjools ISD 2365, Minn., won by FBS.</title>
<headline>G.F.W. Pub. Scjools ISD 2365, Minn., won by FBS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBS Inv. Svcs. said it won $3.295 million of G.F.W. Public Schools ISD 2365, Minn., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.62 percent.</p>
</text>
